<title>HUNGARY: Hungary's BUX ends officially at 5,965.43 pts.</title>
<headline>Hungary's BUX ends officially at 5,965.43 pts.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Budapest Stock Exchange's BUX index closed officially at 5,965.43 points, up 101.00, unchanged from the preliminary figures.</p>
<p>Spot share turnover totalled 4.356 billion forints.</p>
<p>BUX futures settlement prices were higher for all maturities, by between 74 and 169.50 points. June BUX rose 118 points to 6,273.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
